# Curated Design

> Curated Design (Curated Design Studio) is an interior design studio based in London, United Kingdom, founded in 2026 by Josh Gourgey after seven years in interior design. It designs residential, hospitality, and commercial interiors across the UK and on selected international projects, particularly in the Middle East, and also publishes a small collection of iPhone, iPad, and Mac apps, including ProcureCore, a procurement app for interior designers.

{{ site.about.introText | safe }}

- Location: {{ site.settings.location | safe }}
- Areas served: London, the United Kingdom, and selected international projects (particularly the Middle East); remote and overseas clients are supported
- Founder: Josh Gourgey, interior designer, with seven years in interior design across London residential developments, hospitality (hotels and restaurants), and international work
- Free photo-realistic render: the studio produces a free photo-realistic render of your space before you commit to anything
- Pricing: no design fee on furnishing projects where the studio supplies the pieces; clients receive a share of the studio's trade pricing, so the same pieces can cost less than buying them at retail
- Clients: private clients, architects, and developers, on new-build and refurbishment schemes
- Contact: {{ site.settings.email | safe }} or {{ base | safe }}/contact/
- Company: Curated Design Limited, registered in England and Wales (company number 16720521)

